1.1.0
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/83
- Reworked the public modular package from the final hardware-tested runtime.
- Embedded each startup's matching audio directly into its AVI.
- Reduced optional media from separate animation/audio pairs to one file per startup.
- Added Enclave PIP-BOY as an optional startup sequence.
- Replaced the old startup filename switch logic with one indexed startup table.
- Removed hardware-test APPINFO self-registration from the public runtime.
- Removed the legacy TITLE_IMG.JS fallback; TITLE.BIN is the standard title asset.
- Guarded startup/audio hook capture and same-session wrapper restoration.
- Guarded the firmware VERSION fallback so stock boot recovery cannot fail on an undefined VERSION.
- Preserved the hardware-tested startup timings, fades, failsafes, menu order, and selection behavior.

1.0.0
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/79
- Initial public submission of PIP-CO Startup Systems.
- Adds Default Bootup, Mister Handy, Vault Girl, and Deathclaw Ripped Suit startup selections.
- Includes persistent selection and custom startup animation/audio assets.
